# e2e/em-emblems.spec.ts — the operator, 2026-10-14: "i need a visual for emblems. let's make it so
# they go around the player's avatar and hovering the players avatar shows all their emblems."
# Alice (seat 0) has four planeswalkers, each with loyalty enough for its emblem ability (counters
# are explicit: see `w46-b-planeswalker.state`'s header), one more than it costs so none dies. Each activation puts a Forge emblem — an
# effect card with `IsEmblem` — into her Command zone; one loyalty ability per planeswalker a turn,
# so four emblems in one main phase.
